# Security Gate Rule

Security work is risk-based, not an always-on loop.

- Normal coding task: apply the security prohibitions from `AGENTS.md` and run
  targeted checks.
- Security/auth/dependency/CI changes: read `.cursor/skills/security-deploy-gate/SKILL.md`
  and run the relevant checks.
- Deploy/release: run `scripts/security/run-security-gate.ps1` and use
  `security-reports/latest/` as evidence.
- `FAILED` or `BLOCKED` deploy gate blocks deploy-ready claims.